+                                                            -*- Autoconf -*-
+
+# Language-independent M4 Macros for Bison.
+# Copyright (C) 2002, 2004, 2005, 2006, 2007, 2008 Free Software Foundation,
+# Inc.
+
+# This program is free software: you can redistribute it and/or modify
