@@ -0,0 +1,652 @@
+/* Input parser for Bison
+
+   Copyright (C) 1984, 1986, 1989, 1992, 1998, 2000, 2001, 2002, 2003,
+   2005, 2006, 2007 Free Software Foundation, Inc.
+
+   This file is part of Bison, the GNU Compiler Compiler.
