+sending: 'x' (1@10-19)
+thing (1@10-19): 'x' (1@10-19)
+sending: ')' (2@20-29)
+line (0@0-29): '(' (0@0-9) thing (1@10-19) ')' (2@20-29)
+sending: END (3@30-39)
+input (0@29-29): /* Nothing */
+input (2@0-29): line (0@0-29) input (0@29-29)
+Freeing token END (3@30-39)
+Freeing nterm input (2@0-29)
+Successful parse.
