+sending: 'y' (1@10-19)
+10-19: syntax error, unexpected 'y', expecting 'x'
+Freeing token 'y' (1@10-19)
+sending: ')' (2@20-29)
+line (-1@0-29): '(' (0@0-9) error (@10-19) ')' (2@20-29)
+sending: END (3@30-39)
+input (0@29-29): /* Nothing */
+input (2@0-29): line (-1@0-29) input (0@29-29)
+Freeing token END (3@30-39)
