+Stack now 0 2 4 5
+Entering state 6
+Reading a token: Now at end of input.
+syntax error
+Error: popping nterm @4 (: 4)
+DESTROY 4
+Stack now 0 2 4 5
+Error: popping nterm @3 (: 3)
+DESTROY 3
+Stack now 0 2 4
+Error: popping nterm @2 (: 2)
+DESTROY 2
