@@ -0,0 +1,325 @@
+# Process this -*- Autotest -*- file with autom4te.
+
+# Macros for the GNU Bison Test suite.
+# Copyright (C) 2003, 2004, 2005, 2006, 2007, 2008 Free Software Foundation,
+# Inc.
+
