+$accept (7)
+    on left: 0
+CONST_DEC_PART (8)
+    on left: 1, on right: 0
+CONST_DEC_LIST (9)
+    on left: 2 3, on right: 1 3
+CONST_DEC (10)
+    on left: 5, on right: 2 3
+$@1 (11)
+    on left: 4, on right: 5
+
+
+state 0
+
+    0 $accept: . CONST_DEC_PART $end
+
+    $default  reduce using rule 4 ($@1)
+
+    CONST_DEC_PART  go to state 1
+    CONST_DEC_LIST  go to state 2
